3100`: health `200`, create `201`, list `200`, get `200`, update `200`, delete `204`, deleted get `404`.\n- Validation checks on `POST /bookmarks`: missing title `400`, missing url `400`, empty title `400`.\n- Direct SQLite check confirmed the `bookmarks` schema and a persisted row in `data.db`.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
