marks.md:26:- `DELETE /bookmarks/:id` deletes a bookmark and returns `204` or `404`.\ndocs/stories/US-002-crud-bookmarks.md:33:- Queries: list bookmarks and fetch bookmark by id.\ndocs/stories/US-002-crud-bookmarks.md:34:- API: Express JSON handlers under `/bookmarks`.\ndocs/stories/US-002-crud-bookmarks.md:35:- Tables: SQLite `bookmarks` table in `data.db`.\ndocs/stories/US-002-crud-bookmarks.md:57:- Validation checks on `POST /bookmarks`: missing title `400`, missing url `400`, empty title `400`.\ndocs/stories/US-002-crud-bookmarks.md:58:- Direct SQLite check confirmed the `bookmarks` schema and a persisted row in `data.db`.\ndocs/stories/US-004-authentication/execplan.md:5:Add JWT authentication and owner scoping for bookmarks and folders.\ndocs/stories/US-004-authentication/execplan.md:13:- Bearer-token middleware for `/bookmarks` and `/folders`.\ndocs/stories/US-004-authentication/execplan.md:14:- `user_id` ownership on bookmarks and folders.\ndocs/stories/US-004-authentication/design.md:20:- `/bookmarks` and `/folders` require `Authorization: Bearer <token>` and return `401` for missing or invalid tokens.\ndocs/stories/US-004-authentication/design.md:29:- `bookmarks.user_id`: required integer foreign key to `users.id`.\ndocs/stories/US-004-authentication/validation.md:28:curl-based local HTTP checks against /auth, /bookmarks, and /folders\ndocs/stories/US-004-authentication/overview.md:13:- API clients creating and managing bookmarks.\ndocs/stories/US-004-authentication/overview.md:20:- `docs/product/bookmarks.md`\n","exit_code":2,"status":"failed"}}
