ues, and auth protection. |\n    42\t| E2E | Not required for API-only benchmark task. |\n    43\t| Platform | Not required. |\n    44\t| Release | Harness matrix evidence records build and functional check. |\n    45\t\n    46\t## Harness Delta\n    47\t\n    48\tNo harness changes were needed.\n    49\t\n    50\t## Evidence\n    51\t\n    52\t- `npm run build`\n    53\t- Focused local HTTP check on `PORT=3106`: created 12 bookmarks for a new user, confirmed default `{ data, page: 1, limit: 20, total: 12 }`, confirmed `page=2&limit=5` starts at bookmark 6, confirmed invalid `page`/`limit` values return `400`, and confirmed missing auth returns `401`.\n    54\t- `benchmark/lib/check-functional.sh T6-pagination` passed when run with Node v22 PATH matching the installed native `better-sqlite3` module.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
